      "name": "High Marshal",
      "rules": "At the start of the Fight phase, select up to one enemy unit <b>engaged</b> with this unit and roll one D6: <ul><li>On a 2-3, that enemy unit suffers D3 <b>mortal wounds</b>.</li><li>On a 4-5, that enemy unit suffers 3 <b>mortal wounds</b>.</li><li>On a 6+, that enemy unit suffers D3+3 <b>mortal wounds</b>.</li></ul>",
